  "display_title": "The Shameless Thief of Argus",
  "description": "Life is all about taking the easy way for Seokwoo, who feels zero guilt over robbing thousands of players as \"Luke\" in the VR game, Argus. Just when he's leveled up to a master criminal, however, he gets caught and is sentenced to life in prison! Luckily, Luke discovers the will of the vanquished Night King in his cell, which lets him start the game over in exchange for getting revenge on the king's enemies. Though his level and stats have been reset, it's only a matter of time before Argus' infamous thief steals his way back to the top!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
